# Default: treat as text, normalise to LF in the index, check out LF on
# every platform. CI runs on Linux; .editorconfig advertises LF; staying
# consistent stops `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` from failing on
# every line whenever a Windows checkout introduces CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touched by line-ending normalisation.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.tgz  binary
*.tar  binary
*.7z   binary
*.dump binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin  binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.so   binary
*.dylib binary

# Force LF on shell scripts even if a Windows tool tries to touch them.
*.sh   text eol=lf
